   "id": "q5",
   "number": "5",
   "type": "mcq_single",
   "stem": "4 digits are selected from the 5 digits (1, 3, 4, 5, 7). Each square is replaced with different digits such that the equation below is correct. Which of the 5 digits is not used ?\n\n![figure](asset:q5-stem-fig1)\n\n![figure](asset:q5-stem-fig2)",
