   "id": "q7",
   "number": "7",
   "type": "mcq_single",
   "stem": "The total length of rope A and rope B is 1.06 m long. If rope A is longer than rope B by 0.28 m, what is the length of rope B ? Give your answer in centimetres.\n\n![figure](asset:q7-stem-fig)",
