     "text": "39 cm"
    },
    {
     "label": "B",
     "text": "28 cm"
    },
    {
     "label": "C",
     "text": "38 cm"
    },
    {
     "label": "D",
     "text": "40 cm"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "A",
   "solution": "![A Given rope A length + rope B length = 1.06 m ∴ Rope B + 0.28 m + Rope B = 1.06 m ∴ 2 Rope B = 1.06 m – 0.28 m 2 × length of rope B = 0.78 m ∴ Length of rope B = 0.78m 2 = 0.39 m = 0.39 × 100 cm = 39 cm](asset:q7-sol)",
